<style>
  @page { size: A4; margin: 0; }
  .page {
    width: 794px; height: 1123px;
    padding: 50px 60px; box-sizing: border-box;
    overflow: hidden; page-break-after: always;
    position: relative;
    font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif; /* Defaulting to serif for formal look */
  }
  .page:last-child { page-break-after: auto; }
  .header-title {
    font-size: 20pt;
    font-weight: bold;
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 5px;
  }
  .header-subtitle {
    font-size: 14pt;
    text-align: center;
    margin-top: 0;
    margin-bottom: 30px;
  }
  .address-block {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    font-size: 10pt;
    margin-bottom: 30px;
  }
  .contact-info, .mailing-info {
    line-height: 1.4;
  }
  .section-heading {
    font-size: 12pt;
    font-weight: bold;
    margin-top: 25px;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }
  .form-row {
    display: flex;
    margin-bottom: 15px;
    font-size: 11pt;
  }
  .form-row > div {
    flex: 1;
    padding-right: 20px;
  }
  .form-label {
    display: block;
    margin-bottom: 5px;
    font-weight: normal;
  }
  .form-input-line {
    border-bottom: 1px solid #000;
    min-height: 1em;
    margin-top: 2px;
  }
  .signature-block {
    margin-top: 60px;
    font-size: 11pt;
  }
  .signature-line {
    border-bottom: 1px solid #000;
    width: 300px;
    margin-bottom: 5px;
  }
  .disclaimer-text {
    font-size: 10pt;
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin-top: 30px;
    text-align: justify;
  }
</style>

<div class="page">
  <div style="text-align: center;">
    <div class="header-title">SOUTHERN METHODIST UNIVERSITY</div>
    <div class="header-subtitle">DEDMAN SCHOOL OF LAW</div>
  </div>

  <div class="address-block">
    <div class="contact-info">
      <div style="font-size: 10pt;">Public Service Program</div>
      <div style="font-size: 10pt;">Laura G. Burstein, Director</div>
      <div style="font-size: 10pt;">E-mail: <span data-field="contact_email">{{ contact_email }}</span></div>
      <div style="font-size: 10pt;">Website: <span data-field="website_url">{{ website_url }}</span></div>
    </div>
    <div class="mailing-info" style="text-align: right;">
      <div style="font-size: 10pt;">P.O. Box 750112</div>
      <div style="font-size: 10pt;">Dallas, TX 75275-0112</div>
      <div style="font-size: 10pt;">(214) 768-2567/FAX: (214) 768-4688</div>
      <div style="font-size: 10pt;">Carr Collins Jr. Hall – Suite 320</div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 40px;">
    <div style="font-size: 14pt; font-weight: bold;">CONFIRMATION AGREEMENT</div>
  </div>

  <div class="form-row">
    <div style="flex: 1;">
      <span class="form-label">Student Name</span>
      <div class="form-input-line"></div>
    </div>
    <div style="flex: 1;">
      <span class="form-label">Class of</span>
      <div class="form-input-line"></div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="form-row">
    <div style="flex: 1;">
      <span class="form-label">Address</span>
      <div class="form-input-line"></div>
    </div>
    <div style="flex: 1;">
      <span class="form-label">Zip Code</span>
      <div class="form-input-line"></div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="form-row">
    <div style="flex: 1;">
      <span class="form-label">Telephone Number</span>
      <div class="form-input-line"></div>
    </div>
    <div style="flex: 1;">
      <span class="form-label">E-mail</span>
      <div class="form-input-line"></div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="form-row">
    <div style="flex: 1;">
      <span class="form-label">Date</span>
      <div class="form-input-line"></div>
    </div>
    <div style="flex: 1;">
      <span class="form-label">SMU ID#</span>
      <div class="form-input-line"></div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="section-heading">Sponsoring Organization</div>
  <div class="form-row">
    <div style="flex: 1;">
      <span class="form-label">Address</span>
      <div class="form-input-line"></div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="form-row">
    <div style="flex: 1;">
      <span class="form-label">Contact Person</span>
      <div class="form-input-line"></div>
    </div>
    <div style="flex: 1;">
      <span class="form-label">Title</span>
      <div class="form-input-line"></div>
    </div>
    <div style="flex: 1;">
      <span class="form-label">Atty? (Y/N)</span>
      <div class="form-input-line"></div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="form-row">
    <div style="flex: 1;">
      <span class="form-label">Telephone Number</span>
      <div class="form-input-line"></div>
    </div>
    <div style="flex: 1;">
      <span class="form-label">Fax Number</span>
      <div class="form-input-line"></div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="form-row">
    <div style="flex: 1;">
      <span class="form-label">Email</span>
      <div class="form-input-line"></div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="form-row">
    <div style="flex: 1;">
      <span class="form-label">Proposed Assignment</span>
      <div class="form-input-line"></div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="form-row">
    <div style="flex: 1;">
      <span class="form-label">Estimated Total Hours of Work:</span>
      <div class="form-input-line"></div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 20px; font-size: 10pt;">
    <p><strong>STUDENT:</strong> If your Supervisor is not the Contact Person, please list their name(s) and phone number(s) below.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="form-row">
    <div style="flex: 1;">
      <span class="form-label">Name</span>
      <div class="form-input-line"></div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="disclaimer-text">
    <p>I agree to perform all tasks in a professionally responsible manner.</p>
    <p>I confirm that the above student will receive professional supervision. I acknowledge that the student has not been admitted to the Bar, and cannot represent or provide legal advice to the organization, program or its clients and that the organization will not rely on the student's work product in taking any action or forbearing from any actions that may subject the organization, program or its clients to legal liability. I understand that SMU Law School carries professional liability insurance, which covers student activity under the Public Service Program.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="signature-block">
    <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between;">
      <div style="width: 45%;">
        <div class="signature-line"></div>
        <div style="margin-top: 5px;">Student Signature</div>
      </div>
      <div style="width: 45%;">
        <div class="signature-line"></div>
        <div style="margin-top: 5px;">Contact Person Signature</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div style="text-align: center; margin-top: 50px; font-size: 9pt;">
    P:PSP Packets & forms/PSP forms/CONFIRM.doc
  </div>
</div>